      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const email = $json;\n\nif (!email.si_text || !email.bl_text) {\n  throw new Error('SI or BL extracted text is missing');\n}\n\nconst prompt = `You are a shipping-document verification system.\n\nCompare these seven fields between the Shipping Instruction and draft Bill of Lading:\nshipper, consignee, notify_party, port_of_loading, port_of_discharge, container_count, gross_weight_kg.\n\nReturn exactly one JSON object:\n{\n  \"category\": \"BL_COMPARISON\",\n  \"status\": \"OK\",\n  \"review_reason\": null,\n  \"has_defect\": false,\n  \"defect_fields\": [],\n  \"comparison_summary\": \"short explanation\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- OK: all seven fields match.\n- MISMATCH: one or more fields differ. List only differing fields.\n- NEEDS_REVIEW: unreadable, wrong document type, missing attachment, or missing value.\n- For NEEDS_REVIEW, review_reason must be one of:\n  wrong_doc_type, missing_attachment, unreadable, missing_value.\n\nSI DOCUMENT:\n${email.si_text}\n\nBL DOCUMENT:\n${email.bl_text}`;\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      ...email,\n      gemini_body: {\n        contents: [\n          {\n            role: 'user',\n            parts: [{ text: prompt }],\n          },\n        ],\n      },\n    },\n  },\n];"
      },
